-- Avatars (#9, owner Oct 14): whole outfits in the Shop.
--   * "Keep the city life ones as accessible through sale, and the fantasy ones as clothes that can be
--     accessed at higher clout levels. To give players something to work towards": the city seed's
--     shop gains eleven outfits (slot 'outfit'), and every shop entry gains cloutReq (0 for all but the
--     fantasy outfits: Adventurer 1,000, Tactical 2,500, Witch and Ranger 5,000, Spacefarer 10,000,
--     Royalty 25,000).
--   * buy_item is 0009's body plus one check: the player's clout must reach the item's cloutReq
--     ('outfit_needs_clout'). Clout is never spent; it only opens the door.
--   * collector_value (0009) leaves outfits out, so collector pieces keep their value (1.5x the
--     priciest single garment, as lib/city.ts collectorValue).

